From: mscharged-port
Subject: Recharged's trophy room: the game's online menu waits
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

Recharged's trophy room (src/platform/trophy_room.cpp) takes the front
end's camera from the game's online menu to the trophy of the game's cut
online tournament. The online menu stays on top of the scene stack, undrawn
(mscharged_tweak_menu_scene_hidden), and kept taking its players' buttons:
a press where RANKED was opened the RANKED screens from the trophy room.

A new hook, mscharged_tweak_online_menu_held, holds the menu at rest while
the room shows: SHOnlineHub::Update skips its friends' invitations (they
wait for the menu) and returns before its buttons and Back. Its rankings
refresh goes on, and with it the saves, the disconnect loss's restore and
the online error's popup. A set's walk into its RANKED search (tweak patch
0056) and its way out after a lost connection come before it and still go
from the trophy room.

diff --git a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
--- a/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
+++ b/include/mscharged_tweaks.h
@@ -226,6 +226,10 @@
